sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Пользователь
    participant A as FastAPI
    participant P as Pydantic
    participant N as NativeRouteOptimizer
    participant C as C API
    participant G as GeneticSolver
    participant O as OpenCLEvaluator
    U->>A: POST /optimize
    A->>P: validate(request)
    P-->>A: OptimizationRequest
    A->>N: optimize(request)
    N->>C: routeopt_optimize(arrays)
    C->>G: solve(problem)
    G->>O: evaluate_fitness(population)
    O-->>G: fitness vector
    G-->>C: Solution
    C-->>N: routes, offsets, distance
    N-->>A: OptimizationResponse
    A-->>U: JSON result
